  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "#### 🆕 Additions\n- Added `ImmediateMemorySplitExtensions`, providing immediate-mode `Split`/`SplitBy` overloads for `ReadOnlySpan<T>`.\n\n#### ⚙️ Modifications\n- Cleaned up the new Immediate Memory `Split`/`SplitBy` implementation, including an additional `ReadOnlyMemory<T>` overload of the deferred split extension.\n- Removed the `DotExtensions.Memory` package reference; replaced call sites in `ImmediateMemoryForEachExtensions`, `ImmediateMemoryLastIndexExtensions`, `ImmediateMemoryFirstAndLastExtensions`, `ImmediateMemoryAverageExtensions`, `ImmediateMemoryGetRangeExtensions`, and `ImmediateMemoryInsertRangeExtensions` with inline implementations.\n- Bumped **Polyfill** to `11.0.1` (from `10.5.1`).",
